# @name login
POST {{maxxing_app_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "sifre1234"
}

###

GET {{maxxing_app_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

